{%- comment -%}
  Structured PDP content for Horse Culatta Cardholder — Guidi-style: short blurb + 2 accordions.
{%- endcomment -%}

<p class="hygen-product__lede">
  A slim, functional cardholder crafted from full horse culatta—designed for minimal carry while showcasing the hide’s raw texture and character. Handmade in Singapore; each piece displays unique culatta markings.
</p>
{% render 'hygen-product-lead-time', product: product, style: 'detail' %}

<div class="hygen-product__accordion">
  <details class="hygen-product__details">
    <summary class="hygen-product__summary">
      <span>Details</span>
      <span class="hygen-product__summary-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="hygen-product__panel">
      <div class="hygen-product__block">
        <h3 class="hygen-product__block-title">Production</h3>
        <p>Every Horse Culatta Cardholder is made to order and handcrafted individually after your order is placed.</p>
        <p>Constructed from two distinct panels of reverse culatta for a textured, rugged look. Hand-cut, stitched, and finished in Singapore for durability and precision.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hygen-product__block">
        <h3 class="hygen-product__block-title">About</h3>
        <p>Designed for minimal everyday carry, this cardholder features multiple pockets for flexible organization while keeping the leather’s raw character front and center.</p>
        <p>No two cardholders are identical—each one carries the scars, grain, and markings of its hide.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hygen-product__block">
        <h3 class="hygen-product__block-title">Specifications</h3>
        <dl class="hygen-product__specs">
          <div><dt>Material</dt><dd>Full reverse horse culatta</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Dimensions</dt><dd>11 × 8 cm</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Layout</dt><dd>4 multi-card pockets, 1 cash slot</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Includes</dt><dd>Signature Guised box packaging &amp; dust bag</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="hygen-product__block">
        <h3 class="hygen-product__block-title">Features</h3>
        <ul class="hygen-product__list">
          <li>Two distinct panels of reverse culatta for a textured, rugged look</li>
          <li>4 flexible card pockets for daily essentials</li>
          <li>1 top cash slot for folded notes</li>
          <li>Hand-cut, stitched &amp; finished in Singapore</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="hygen-product__details">
    <summary class="hygen-product__summary">
      <span>Material and care</span>
      <span class="hygen-product__summary-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="hygen-product__panel">
      <div class="hygen-product__block">
        <h3 class="hygen-product__block-title">Material notes</h3>
        <p>Reverse horse culatta showcases natural calluses, scars, and grain variation.</p>
        <p>Each cardholder matures differently, developing a unique patina over time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hygen-product__block">
        <h3 class="hygen-product__block-title">Care &amp; maintenance</h3>
        <ul class="hygen-product__list">
          <li>Avoid water exposure; allow to air-dry naturally if damp.</li>
          <li>Keep away from direct heat or prolonged sunlight.</li>
          <li>Condition sparingly with a neutral leather balm.</li>
          <li>Store in the included dust bag when not in use.</li>
          <li>Handle with clean hands to maintain an even patina.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>
